WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
You wrote five sentences from three sources. Then source A publishes a correction.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Each claim is bound to a passage in a specific source version, with a recorded review.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Revise source A. Inspector lists what is affected: C1 directly, C4 through a confirmed dependency. C2, C3, C5 are untouched.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.500
C4 shows why: the claim it depends on, C1, needs re-review. Path C1 → C4.

5
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.500
The earlier review stays in history. Nothing is flipped automatically.

6
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:40.000
Export a standalone report, or review your own text. Runs in the browser. No upload.

